1
00:00:00,103 --> 00:00:01,803
(Leonard:)Don't know.

2
00:00:03,106 --> 00:00:05,836
(Penny:)I wonder if it's from, like, ancient Rome...

3
00:00:06,042 --> 00:00:10,142
(Penny:)...where they'd actually chop
somebody's ass off and then go, "Here."

4
00:00:11,815 --> 00:00:15,345
(Penny:)You know, to appease Loseroneous,
the god of losers.

5
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,050
(Sheldon:)I am not a loser.

6
00:00:18,655 --> 00:00:22,455
(Sheldon:)Pictionary is not a true test
of any real intelligence or skill.

7
00:00:23,226 --> 00:00:26,826
(Leonard:)In all fairness,
Pictionary has verbal skills, visual skills.

8
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:28,360
(Leonard:)A pretty well-rounded game.

9
00:00:28,565 --> 00:00:32,025
(Sheldon:)Lot of big talk from a man
who can't draw a chocolate chip cookie.

10
00:00:32,836 --> 00:00:35,966
(Penny:)Fine, pick another game.
Amy and I will beat you at anything.

11
00:00:36,172 --> 00:00:39,042
(Sheldon:)All right. Let's play...

12
00:00:39,209 --> 00:00:41,469
(Sheldon:)...Physics Fiesta.

13
00:00:42,579 --> 00:00:46,179
- Oh, come on. What is that?
- It's a game that I just invented...

14
00:00:46,349 --> 00:00:50,619
(Sheldon:)...in which the participants answer
physics questions in remedial Spanish.

15
00:00:50,787 --> 00:00:52,307
(Howie Mandel:)Uh...

16
00:00:52,489 --> 00:00:56,019
Donde esta el boson de Higgs?

